<!-- Launcher icon, foreground: direction 01, "The Page on the Nomad",
     black ink over the white background layer. -->
<!-- The Nomad as a bezel with a drop cap on its screen, the two grip lines scored
     down the sides, and the pen docked at the right. Coordinates are the design's
     own; they overrun the 108dp canvas, so one group scales and centres them
     inside the 72dp region every launcher mask must keep; without it the pen
     falls outside the mask entirely. The R is Literata Bold outlined, the serif
     the reader already sets its pages in, because a VectorDrawable has no text.
     One even-odd path: the body, less the screen and the two grip lines, with the
     drop cap nested back inside the screen so it fills again. -->
